BT 1 0 0 1 0 62 Tm /F1 10 Tf 12 TL 1.440556 Tw (The report is strong overall. It presents a clear multi-component portfolio, with clear choices about which) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.136962 Tw (strategies are used on each series, how trades are entered and exited, how capital is allocated, and how) Tj T* 0 Tw .812256 Tw (positions are sized. The Part 3 analysis is also very good. The report compares expectations with the final) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.001147 Tw (results well, explains performance at both asset and strategy level, and gives a sensible discussion of the) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.457025 Tw (drop in PD Ratio. There are also good reflections on regime drift, static classification, mean-reversion) Tj T* 0 Tw (performance, dynamic allocation, volatility adaptation and trend filters.) Tj T* ET
Q
