BT 1 0 0 1 0 74 Tm /F1 10 Tf 12 TL 2.215257 Tw (The optimisation and robustness testing are substantial and well documented. The report includes grid) Tj T* 0 Tw .54985 Tw (search, train/test splitting, rolling-window analysis, allocation sensitivity and component testing. This section) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.144882 Tw (would have been stronger with a clearer comparison between the optimiser\222s preferred strategies and the) Tj T* 0 Tw .485197 Tw (final versions that were actually submitted. It also looks as though some Part 2 validation results were used) Tj T* 0 Tw .201147 Tw (to make later strategy adjustments, so these results are useful but not a completely independent final check.) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.077603 Tw (Some of the robustness checks also needed a clearer explanation of what extra insight they provided beyond) Tj T* 0 Tw (the equity curve and component-level results.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.02362 84.02362 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 50 Tm .292556 Tw 12 TL /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg (The justification for the submitted strategy is convincing, especially where the report explains why simpler or) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.003853 Tw (more robust variants were chosen instead of just selecting the most highly optimised versions. Overall, this is) Tj T* 0 Tw .131772 Tw (a well-structured, detailed and coherent report. There are a few places where the argument could have been) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.488334 Tw (tightened, but the report includes an appropriate short reference list and a well-organised, well-explained) Tj T* 0 Tw (source code/R) Tj (&) Tj (D package. Great stuff.) Tj T* ET
